    <profile name="Flank Speed" id="40e8-ed82-d0d0-0b10" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time this model Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 8&quot; to the Move characteristic of this model.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Predatory Ambush" id="0bb8-b3ec-26c8-51fe" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">If this model Remained Stationary in your previous Movement phase, each time this model makes an attack with its Titan Neutron Laser or Nemesis Volcano Cannon that targets a Monster or Vehicle unit, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Wrath of the Omnissiah" id="d4a0-c5e6-f567-9e53" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. That unit must take a Battle-shock test with a -2 Penalty. If that unit is Battle-Shocked as a result of this rule, that unit takes 2D3 Mortal Wounds</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Judgement of the Omnissiah" id="1804-fd27-b744-6845" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Once per turn, in your Shooting phase, after this model has resolved its attacks, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks. That unit becomes Judged until the end of the turn


• Each time this model makes an attack that targets the Judged unit, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If the Judged unit is a Monster or Vehicle, you can also re-roll a Wound roll of 1 for that attack.
• If the Judged unit is Titanic, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of this model&apos;s attacks against it by 1 for the remainder of the phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="God-Machine" id="c714-d9e0-0992-a6b0" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">This model is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="World-Shaker" id="0d43-759f-e3d1-3dc5" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">At the end of your Movement phase, select one enemy unit within 24&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Movement phase, subtract 3 from that unit’s Objective Control characteristic (to a minimum of 0), and that unit cannot benefit from cover.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Imperator Colossus" id="b4af-7994-cec2-eb75" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend five times that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mighty Colossus" id="b102-e276-6366-a141" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend three times that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Striding Colossus" id="b5ca-2566-fa37-fb09" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time you target this model with a Stratagem, you must spend twice that Stratagem’s stated CP cost to do so.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
