    <profile name="Deadly Demise D6+6" id="0494-269d-55f7-2c76" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Some models have &apos;Deadly Demise x&apos; listed in their abilities. When such a model is destroyed, roll one D6 before removing it from play (if such a model is a TRANSPORT, roll before any embarked models disembark). On a 6, each unit within 6&quot; of that model suffers a number of mortal wounds denoted by &apos;x&apos; (if this is a random number, roll separately for each unit within 6&quot;).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
